    explanation: "Goodput Calculation - Goodput = fractextSuccessful packetstextTotal time - Total time = i + N - Successful packets = i - (i - N) = N after N RTT - Goodput = fracii+N = 1 - fracNi+N - Since i >> N, Goodput approx 1 - fracNi Quick Tip Use the fact that goodput = packets sent / time elapsed; eliminate options that don’t match the 1‑unit transmission time assumption."
