    question: "Let a and b be two sorted arrays containing n integers each, in non-decreasing order. Let c be a sorted array containing 2n integers obtained by merging the two arrays a and b. Assuming the arrays are indexed starting from 0, consider the following four statements I. a[i] ≥ b [i] Rightarrow c[2i] ≥ a [i] II. a[i] ≥ b [i] Rightarrow c[2i] ≥ b [i] III. a[i] ≥ b [i] Rightarrow c[2i] ≤ a [i] IV. a[i] ≥ b [i] Rightarrow c[2i] ≤ b [i] Which of the following is TRUE?",
    image: null,
