    question: "A Binary Search Tree (BST) stores values in the range 37 to 573. Consider the following sequence of keys. I.   81,537,102,439,285,376,305 II.  52,97,121,195,242,381,472 III. 142,248,520,386,345,270,307 IV.  550,149,507,395,463,402,270 Which of the following statements is TRUE?",
