    type: "MCQ", marks: 2,
    question: "The following three are known to be the preorder, inorder and postorder sequences of a binary tree. But it is not known which is which.  I. MBCAFHPYK II. KAMCBYPFH III. MABCKYFPH  Pick the true statement from the following.",
