    type: "MSQ", marks: 2,
    question: "Consider the following relational schemas along with all the functional dependencies that hold on them.  R_1(A,B,C,D,E): \\D→ E, EA→ B, EB→ C\\  R_2(A,B,C,D): \\A→ D, A→ B, C→ A\\  Which of the following statement(s) is/are TRUE?",
    image: null,
