    question: "Let fsa(x) be a predicate meaning \"x is a finite state automaton\", and pda(y) be a predicate meaning \"y is a pushdown automaton\".  Let equivalent(a,b) mean \"a and b are equivalent\".  Which of the following first-order logic statements represents:  **Each finite state automaton has an equivalent pushdown automaton.**",
