    question: "The trapezoidal method is used to evaluate the numerical value of ∈t_0^1e^x dx .  Consider the following values for the step size h. i. 10^-2 ii. 10^-3 iii. 10^-4 iv. 10^-5 For which of these values of the step size h, is the computed value guaranteed to be correct to seven decimal places. Assume that there are no round-off errors in the computation.",
