    question: "The figure shows two 4-tile patterns. ![](https://res.cloudinary.com/dvbkwxlf2/image/upload/v1783365681/gate_pyq/xcvfsdvhfa6ipbyyvsyc.jpg) Either one or both of the patterns can be used any number of times and in any orientation to construct a new pattern. Which one of the options below cannot be constructed by using only these two 4-tile patterns assuming there are no overlaps among them?",
